WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.880 --> 00:00:04.070
In Shanghai, a reader of
Chinese opens your page,

2
00:00:04.140 --> 00:00:06.250
and the lunch sentence is in English.

3
00:00:06.720 --> 00:00:10.010
Home or work comes from a
ternary of English words,

4
00:00:10.260 --> 00:00:12.910
and nothing in the app
translates the sentence.

5
00:00:13.840 --> 00:00:16.260
General Translation lets
you wrap whole sentences

6
00:00:16.300 --> 00:00:18.850
in T and express conditions with Branch.

7
00:00:19.700 --> 00:00:24.910
Run npx gt init, choose Japanese
and Chinese, and sign in.

8
00:00:25.760 --> 00:00:30.890
Put the sentence in a T component with a
Branch, so the translator sees it whole.

9
00:00:31.440 --> 00:00:36.930
Run npx gt translate to write Japanese and
Chinese with the place before the verb.

10
00:00:37.440 --> 00:00:42.530
In Shanghai, the page now shows the
Chinese sentence for home and for work.
